id=sygic_fps_unlock
name=Sygic FPS Unlock
version=v1.8
versionCode=9
author=davidw
description=Bind-mounts patched base.apk + arm64-v8a split of com.sygic.aura over the installed ones. Built via work/build_patched_xapk.py --all -S skin_export. Split libsygic.so: (1) CSDKMapView fps-override default -10.0->+120.0 (BALANCED->PERFORMANCE). (2) CViewCamera::UpdateRotation's hardcoded InterpolatorForCurve(...,0) call changed to (...,2): navigation-follow camera rotation eases with Decelerate instead of Linear. Base: (1) SettingItemsManager.E()'s FEATURE_DEBUG_MENU.isActive() check nop'd out, exposing the internal Debug menu. (2) LowGL.MAX_SHORTER_DIMENSION 1080px render-surface cap raised to 32767 (both call sites), true device resolution instead of downscaling. (3) ModalManagerImpl.checkShowPromoDialog() (uX2.D0()) forced onto its existing "nothing to show" early-return path -- disables the startup "buy Premium Plus" webview promo dialog, which had no license/premium check at all and fired for lifetime/premium owners same as free users. Plus night-mode skin color edits (colors.area color.surface, etc.) from skin_export/. Original Play Store install/signature untouched.
